{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43620","headline":"还丹可成诗联句 · 清昼","name":"还丹可成诗联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羽化自仙骨，延年资养生。\n金经啓灵秘，玉液流至精。\n八石思共炼，九丹知可成。\n吾心苟无妄，神理期合幷。\n封竈用六一，置门考休京。\n浮光含日彩，圆质焕云英。\n持此保寿命，服之颐性情。\n跂予望仙侣，高咏昇天行。\n鹤驾方可致，霓裳定将迎。\n不因五色药，安着七真名。\n挥妙在微密，全功知感诚。\n与君弃城市，携手游蓬瀛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"清昼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43620.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43620","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}